WEBVTT

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:30.216
nad internetom.

00:00:30.216 --> 00:00:35.140
Naslov je bio: "Oblak nad oblakom".

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.123
Izgleda da je oblak svakome

00:00:37.123 --> 00:00:39.397
standardna metafora za pesimizam.

00:00:39.397 --> 00:00:41.550
Po meni, oni su divni, zar ne?

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.663
Samo smo propustili njihovu lepotu

00:00:44.663 --> 00:00:46.663
jer su sveprisutni,

00:00:46.663 --> 00:00:50.012
pa ih obično

00:00:50.012 --> 00:00:51.448
ljudi i ne primećuju.

00:00:51.448 --> 00:00:54.327
Ne zapažaju lepotu,
ne zapažaju ni oblake,

00:00:54.327 --> 00:00:56.957
dok ne zaklone sunce.

00:00:56.957 --> 00:00:59.262
Ljudi razmišljaju o oblacima

00:00:59.262 --> 00:01:01.342
kao o stvarima koje smetaju.